OL,3,GNEWSANo 'switch' to stop small boats,
OL,4,ALucy Powell tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Conservatives say Labour has
OL,7,Flost control of Britain's borders, and
OL,8,Fa "radically different" approach is
OL,9,Fneeded.
